      "mergedPostDetails": "It's nice to add drone function to VRC+, but for some reason... the normal stream camera is now bugged.\n\nA weird bug too. Camera itself is working fine, but the output on camera display itself is broken, like layers are missing or no output send to camera screen. It stay totally white, even i swapped pins (to swap layers).\n\nSo i cannot see myself anymore, and cannot make photos with it because screen is white.\n\nThis issue lucky can solved by turn stream camera on/off (2nd pic). But it's annoying bug happens again if i go join another world or re-join the world. It will turn white again.\n\nThis is done in VR mode (PC mode is just not possible).\n\nAlso while change worlds in loading part, white screen can already observed (3rd pic).",
